OL,3,APressure grows on Trump's Commerce
OL,4,ASecretary Lutnick in fallout from
OL,5,ANvidia scandal
OL,6,
OL,7,FMegaspeed, the firm she worked for, had
OL,8,Fbeen probed by US government agencies
OL,9,Fover suspicions it had been smuggling
OL,10,FNvidia chips into China, reports said,
OL,11,Fbut is not on a list of firms that US
OL,12,Fcompanies are prevented from working
OL,13,Fwith.
